    "SHARED ANCESTRY IS ESTABLISHED, NOT SIMILARITY. patch_embed cosine 0.955 with a near-zero shuffle control proves RETFound was initialised from this DINOv2-L. It does NOT show the encoder is nearly unchanged: on the same tensor the relative Frobenius distance is 0.495, i.e. the update has half the norm of the weight itself, and the deeper attention blocks fall to cosine 0.17.",
